Q2. Will this code compile?

interface A {
    void show();
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        A obj = () -> {
            System.out.println("Hello");
            System.out.println("Java 8");
        };
    }
}

ANSWER:
YES, it compiles.

Lambda body can contain multiple statements when {} is used.


