Q9. Predict the output.

interface A {
    int test(int x);
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        A a = x -> x * 2;

        System.out.println(a.test(10));
    }
}

ANSWER:
20

IMPORTANT:

x -> x * 2

is equivalent to:

x -> {
    return x * 2;
}


