Q10. Will this compile?

interface A {
    void show(int x);
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {

        A a = (x, y) -> System.out.println(x + y);
    }
}

ANSWER:
NO — Compile-time error.

Reason:
The functional method has only ONE parameter:

void show(int x);

But the lambda provides TWO parameters:

(x, y)


